  "introduction": "NAMAZ OF IMAM AL-BAQIR (A)\n\nThis prayer consists of two units in each of which Surah al-Faatehah is recited once and the following litany is repeated one hundred times:\n\nAfter the namaz recite the dua of Imam Al Baqir (a.s.):",
  "versesCount": 4,
  "verses": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "arabic": "سُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ",
      "translation": "All glory be to Allah,"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "arabic": "وَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ",
      "translation": "all praise be to Allah,"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "arabic": "وَ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ",
      "translation": "there is no god save Allah,"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "arabic": "وَ اللهُ اَكْبَرُ۔",
      "translation": "and Allah is the Greatest."
    }
  ],
